8 0 obj
<<
/Title (HC705BD7GRS, 68HC05BD7, 68HC705BD7, 68HC05BD2 SPECIFICATION REV 2.0 \(General Release\) - Data Sheet)
/Author (Freescale Semiconductor, Inc.)
/Subject (HC705BD7GRS: The MC68HC05BD7 HCMOS microcontroller is a member of the M68HC05 Family of low-cost single-chip microcontrollers. It is particularly suitable as multi-sync computer monitor controller. This 8-bit microcontroller unit \(MCU\) contains an on-chip oscillator, CPU, RAM, ROM, DDC12AB module, parallel I/O, Pulse Width Modulator, Multi-Function Timer, 6-bitADC, and SYNC Processor.)
/Keywords (HC705BD7GRS, 68HC05BD7, 68HC705BD7, 68HC05BD2, MC68HC05BD7, HCMOS, M68HC05 Family, single-chip, multi-sync computer monitor controller)
>>
endobj
